  {
   "title": "Sliding vowel count",
   "kind": "best",
   "time": "O(n)",
   "space": "O(1)",
   "idea": [
    {
     "md": "Count vowels in the first `k` letters. Then for each `i ≥ k`, add 1 if `s[i]` is a vowel and subtract 1 if\n`s[i − k]` was one. Keep the maximum.\n\n**Invariant.** After the update at `i`, `count` is the number of vowels in `s[i − k + 1 .. i]`."
    }
   ],
   "build": [
    "A helper `isVowel(c)` returning 1 or 0.",
    "Count over `s[0..k−1]`; that's `best`.",
    "Slide: `count += isVowel(s[i]) − isVowel(s[i − k])`; update `best`.",
    "Return `best`."
   ],
   "code": {
    "python": "class Solution:\n    def mostVowels(self, s: str, k: int) -> int:\n        vowel = [c in \"aeiou\" for c in s]\n        count = sum(vowel[:k])\n        best = count\n        for i in range(k, len(s)):\n            count += vowel[i] - vowel[i - k]\n            best = max(best, count)\n        return best\n",
    "java": "class Solution {\n    private int vowel(char c) {\n        return c == 'a' || c == 'e' || c == 'i' || c == 'o' || c == 'u' ? 1 : 0;\n    }\n\n    public int mostVowels(String s, int k) {\n        int count = 0;\n        for (int i = 0; i < k; i++) count += vowel(s.charAt(i));\n        int best = count;\n        for (int i = k; i < s.length(); i++) {\n            count += vowel(s.charAt(i)) - vowel(s.charAt(i - k));\n            best = Math.max(best, count);\n        }\n        return best;\n    }\n}\n",
    "cpp": "class Solution {\n    static int vowel(char c) {\n        return c == 'a' || c == 'e' || c == 'i' || c == 'o' || c == 'u';\n    }\n\npublic:\n    int mostVowels(string& s, int k) {\n        int count = 0;\n        for (int i = 0; i < k; i++) count += vowel(s[i]);\n        int best = count;\n        for (int i = k; i < (int) s.size(); i++) {\n            count += vowel(s[i]) - vowel(s[i - k]);\n            best = max(best, count);\n        }\n        return best;\n    }\n};\n",
    "c": "static int vowel(char c) {\n    return c == 'a' || c == 'e' || c == 'i' || c == 'o' || c == 'u';\n}\n\nint mostVowels(char* s, int k) {\n    int n = strlen(s), count = 0;\n    for (int i = 0; i < k; i++) count += vowel(s[i]);\n    int best = count;\n    for (int i = k; i < n; i++) {\n        count += vowel(s[i]) - vowel(s[i - k]);\n        if (count > best) best = count;\n    }\n    return best;\n}\n"
   },
